>>>    FDC vmstate-ified
>>>    Migration stream use compile time value of MAX_FD
>>>
>>> Since 7138fcfbf7dd MAX_FD has always been defined as 2.
>>>
>>> Since d7a6c2703577 MAX_FD can not be different than 2 without breakin=
g
>>> migration.
>>>
